{"name": "Crystalyn", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the Game</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.poster.avif?t=1787651529\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.webm?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/06883c23bd56509f3f1a9c83e3ad5c03.mp4?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you enjoy chaos? Unreasonable amounts of loot? Killing bosses that are 10 times as big as you?<br/><br/>Welcome to Crystalyn, a bullet-hell looter shooter where getting stupidly powerful is not a bug, it's the whole point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Push your build to the limit</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.poster.avif?t=1787651529\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.webm?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/b75a0b76161ff637d1bf82961b2c00b0.mp4?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade a big skill tree, collect boss drops, and equip gear that turns you into a walking destruction machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no such thing as too many bullets. I checked.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight. Loot. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras_big/9b3cdf453f77a83a6bfb158cf06afd1a.webp?t=1787651529\" height=\"568\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/9b3cdf453f77a83a6bfb158cf06afd1a.avif?t=1787651529\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drop into maps with increasing difficulty, slaughter everything that moves, grab their loot, and bring it back to the lobby. Upgrade. Equip. Prestige. Go back in. Do it again. The enemies won't get a break, and you won't get bored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Infinite ways to get stronger</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.poster.avif?t=1787651529\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.webm?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/7abf85a5088676b5da2930590a85411b.mp4?t=1787651529\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade the skill tree, buy new weapons, collect better boss drops, use incantations, prestige and earn ultra powerful cards. You are only getting stronger, until the whole screen is covered in bullets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It never stops</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras_big/57ac1caac5d49b559e449b120b423160.webp?t=1787651529\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/extras/57ac1caac5d49b559e449b120b423160.avif?t=1787651529\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More difficulty settings, more maps, more chaos. The game does not slow down. Neither should you.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Start with one bullet. End with hundreds. Crystalyn is a fast-paced top-down bullet-hell looter shooter about pushing your build to its absolute limits. Fight monsters, defeat bosses, and turn their loot into unstoppable firepower.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754460/d7cd9a947c47e67e55d99bf527c103373cd9661c/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787651529", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Looter Shooter", "Hack and Slash", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Top-Down Shooter", "Twin Stick Shooter"], "developers": "Soulstone Forge", "publishers": "Soulstone Forge", "release_date": "Aug 26, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4754460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xWYzgu2jC4g", "first_seen": 1780956000.0, "review_rank": 443}